      "title": "Upstream request has no timeout",
      "description": "fetchStatus uses http.Get, which runs on the default client with no timeout. The handler also ignores the request context. A slow or hanging upstream holds every GET /upstream goroutine open indefinitely and can exhaust the server. Build the request with the handler's context and send it through a client with a Timeout set.",
